sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as Router / Gateway
    participant H as Handler
    
    C->>R: Request with invalid mode URL (e.g. /mode/invalid)
    R->>H: Validate mode
    H-->>R: Mode Not Found / Invalid
    
    Note over R: Fallback triggered
    
    R-->>C: Redirect / Fallback to default mode URL
